alue of <img src=\"/media/b6ff155c16295b32e6a13212752ffa984897a6c8.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> + y is _________.</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"-6","high":"-6"},"solution":"<p>-6</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/7b379fb92f58e92f3fbf6ac54bf092791fed2bf7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":14,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Consider four students in a class, and their marks in exam was 40, 50, 60 and 70. The standard deviation of this data set is ________ (upto two decimal places).</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"11.18","high":"11.18"},"solution":"<p>11.18 [11.00 - 12.00]</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/8dd4ac211bd7376891a8303332fff4c8f628bc4d.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":15,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>If <img src=\"/media/c945ccc5ab5e639761a935beaea515a6d6f8d1f3.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> then the value of α is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p><img src=\"/media/27f46cc99fc57dde9ea547cb503c71cb354fc1ff.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p><img src=\"/media/365e2b44babac3970837c94874ce64eed92065e2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p><img src=\"/media/b538cfaa9047539db74aa7c14482cd3f97737315.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p><img src=\"/media/d1f0c65e6c405c0b05d18cd00cd8ca8649b0768c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(c)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/6f66cee251aae8b70e7fe14f83c694a780fc51ae.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":16,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>Which of the following represents the <em>LU</em> decomposition of the given matrix. (Using Doolittle’s and method)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/